/-!
# Proof skeleton for fractal-dilation spherical maximal estimates

This file names the analytic and geometric inputs used in the non-endpoint
proofs of Theorems 1 and 2 of Anderson--Hughes--Roos--Seeger.  The final
assembly keeps the diagonal and off-diagonal analytic ingredients separate.

The existing Stein development is used only for the already-established
diagonal ingredients.  The off-diagonal assertion of Theorem 1 is proved
from the paper's own two sources: the physical Minkowski dyadic estimate and
the finite-shell quasi-Assouad `TT*` estimate near `Q4`, followed by their
strict interpolation.  The lower-bound side is supplied by the four test
families below.
-/

